flowchart TD
 SRC[CoreScript source] --> LEX[Lexer] --> PAR[Parser] --> AST[Native AST]
 AST --> SEM[Semantic analysis and name resolution] --> COMP[Compiler] --> IR[Typed CoreSpirit IR]
 IR --> OPT[Optimizer] --> PLAN[Execution planner]
 PLAN --> VM[Reference VM]
 PLAN --> OVM[Optimized VM]
 VM --> RT[CoreSpiritRuntime]
 OVM --> RT
 COL[Columnar market data] --> RT
 HOST[Host-owned data resolver] --> RT
 RT --> OUT[Retained outputs] --> VA[Vela output adapter] --> VE[CoreSpiritVelaEngine] --> VELA[Vela chart]
 subgraph Compute backends
  CPU[CPU kernels]
  WASM[WASM scalar/SIMD]
  GPU[GPU adapter - host-limited]
 end
 CPU --> PLAN
 WASM --> PLAN
 GPU --> PLAN
 subgraph Broker authority boundary
  AUTO[Automation] --> RISK[Mandatory risk/policy] --> GATE[Execution gateway] --> BROKER[Broker host]
 end
 RT -. events/order intents .-> AUTO
 subgraph Pine compatibility coupling
  PFE[PineV6Frontend] --> PAR
  SEM -. direct import .-> PB[Pine builtin registry]
  RT -. math/string/color .-> PB
  LS[Language service] -. completions .-> PFR[Pine feature registry]
  AST -. Pine metadata .-> IR
 end
